---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import workshopPhoto from '../assets/about-workshop.png';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Electrical Engineering Student @ Princeton University"
>
  <article class="prose-wrap prose about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About Me</h1>
    <Image src={workshopPhoto} alt="Working on electronics at my bench" />
    <p>
      My name is Noah, and I am a Princeton student passionate about
      hardware and electronics. I hope to work in computer chip design,
      defense technology, or power electronics, and these projects are to
      fine tune my interest and develop my skills.
    </p>
    <p>
      This blog is where I document projects, thoughts, and cool
      information I'm learning. Most of the posts are going to deal with
      electronics, but I may also write about programming or mechanical
      projects. I do not sell any of my projects.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
  }
</style>
